":func:`psutil.disk_io_counters` now reports additional metrics on Linux and "
"FreeBSD:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2016/real-process-memory-in-python.rst:167
msgid ":field:`busy_time`: the time spent doing actual I/Os (in milliseconds)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2016/real-process-memory-in-python.rst:168
